From 393d28e0f2a8d532fd4a2a0ee1715f6f88b673ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chiro <chiro2001@163.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 14:44:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 269/283] fix(execution): close U3 round-3 narrow findings from
 verify-0046-u3-r2

Round-3 fixes on top of the round-2 strict-import work:

* R2-G1: strict import now also checks each registered provider entry against
  the local canonical manifest collection shape: canonically non-empty
  contracts/dtypes/numeric_modes/required_features/preconditions/threads/pack/
  library must stay non-empty, static required keys must be present, and
  canonically empty collections must not gain entries.  Probe-dependent
  optional keys (an unavailable library's missing arch facts) stay optional
  and scalar values are not pinned.  The ten emptied-collection repro cases
  all fail ARTIFACT_MISMATCH/capability_structure_mismatch; doctor flags a
  programmatically supplied emptied manifest as provider_identity failed /
  fail_closed=true (rc 0, --strict rc 3), while the CLI file path reports the
  structured request-level rc 1 refusal.
* R2-G2: the plan wrapper top-level digest is now required; a wrapper with
  the digest removed (or tampered) is refused with
  ARTIFACT_MISMATCH/plan_wrapper_digest_mismatch while the nested
  plan_digest is still validated.
* Help text: doctor --help now documents all four exit codes via an epilog,
  including request-level status 1; the --strict help line also spells out
  request-level 1 and usage 2.
* Redaction vs digests: emitted documents stay self-verifying.  Provider
  rows hash the actually emitted row (manifest_digest) and keep
  manifest_canonical_digest as the full-manifest anchor when redacted.  The
  plan wrapper's embedded capability snapshot digest is recomputed over the
  emitted (basename) view and carries canonical_digest for the full snapshot
  identity; --show-paths emits the canonical snapshot with digest ==
  capability_digest.  Wrapper digests still cover everything.

Adds 13 focused tests: 10 emptied-collection refusals, doctor fact path,
redacted self-verification, wrapper missing digest, CLI structured refusal
and help-code assertions.  Focused discovery 68 + env registry 16; execution
related 420 passed; collect 2049 (base 1994, +55) unchanged from round-3
additions only.
